    <item>
      <title>Java Exception Handling Tips</title>
      <link>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/java-exception-handling-tips/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 20 Oct 2025 17:20:00 +0700</pubDate>
      <guid>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/java-exception-handling-tips/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Xử lý exception giúp code ổn định và dễ debug.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;ví-dụ&#34;&gt;Ví dụ&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-java&#34; data-lang=&#34;java&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;try&lt;/span&gt; {&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; result &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; 10 &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt; 0;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;} &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;catch&lt;/span&gt;(ArithmeticException e) {&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    System.&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;out&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;println&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;Cannot divide by zero!&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;);&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;} &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;finally&lt;/span&gt; {&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    System.&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;out&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;println&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;Always executed&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;);&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;}&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;mẹo&#34;&gt;Mẹo&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Sử dụng &lt;code&gt;try-with-resources&lt;/code&gt; cho AutoCloseable.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Không catch generic &lt;code&gt;Exception&lt;/code&gt; trừ khi thật sự cần.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;!-- raw HTML omitted --&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;N.B.&lt;/strong&gt; Quản lý exception tốt giúp ứng dụng chạy ổn định và dễ bảo trì.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>JavaScript Modules Explained</title>
      <link>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/javascript-modules-explained/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 20 Oct 2025 17:10:00 +0700</pubDate>
      <guid>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/javascript-modules-explained/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Modules giúp tách code thành các file reusable.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;ví-dụ&#34;&gt;Ví dụ&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;math.js&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-javascript&#34; data-lang=&#34;javascript&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;function&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;add&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;) { &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;+&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;; }&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;function&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;sub&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;) { &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;; }&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;app.js&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-javascript&#34; data-lang=&#34;javascript&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; { &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;add&lt;/span&gt; } &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;./math.js&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;console&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;log&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;add&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;)); &lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// 5&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!-- raw HTML omitted --&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;N.B.&lt;/strong&gt; Modules giúp tránh global scope pollution và tăng maintainability.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Functional Programming in Java</title>
      <link>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/functional-programming-in-java/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 20 Oct 2025 17:00:00 +0700</pubDate>
      <guid>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/functional-programming-in-java/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Lập trình hàm (Functional Programming) trong Java được giới thiệu mạnh mẽ từ Java 8, mở ra cách tiếp cận mới cho việc viết code ngắn gọn, dễ đọc và ít lỗi hơn.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;1-tư-duy-lập-trình-hàm-là-gì&#34;&gt;1. Tư duy lập trình hàm là gì?&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Lập trình hàm tập trung vào việc sử dụng các &lt;strong&gt;hàm không có side effect&lt;/strong&gt;, dữ liệu &lt;strong&gt;bất biến (immutable)&lt;/strong&gt; và &lt;strong&gt;xử lý dữ liệu bằng hàm thuần túy (pure functions)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>JavaScript Event Loop Demystified</title>
      <link>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/javascript-event-loop-demystified/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 20 Oct 2025 16:50:00 +0700</pubDate>
      <guid>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/javascript-event-loop-demystified/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Event Loop là trái tim của JS runtime.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;nguyên-lý-hoạt-động&#34;&gt;Nguyên lý hoạt động&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Call Stack&lt;/strong&gt;: Nơi lưu function đang chạy.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Message Queue&lt;/strong&gt;: Nơi lưu callback.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Event Loop&lt;/strong&gt;: Kiểm tra stack rỗng để xử lý queue.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-javascript&#34; data-lang=&#34;javascript&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;console&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;log&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;Start&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;);&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;setTimeout&lt;/span&gt;(() =&amp;gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;console&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;log&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;Timeout&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;), &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;);&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;console&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;log&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;End&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;);&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;output&#34;&gt;Output&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Start&#xD;&#xA;End&#xD;&#xA;Timeout&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;!-- raw HTML omitted --&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;N.B.&lt;/strong&gt; Hiểu event loop giúp debug async code và promise chaining dễ dàng hơn.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Java 17 Features You Must Know</title>
      <link>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/java-17-features-you-must-know/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 20 Oct 2025 16:40:00 +0700</pubDate>
      <guid>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/java-17-features-you-must-know/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Java 17 mang đến nhiều cải tiến hữu ích.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;nổi-bật&#34;&gt;Nổi bật&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sealed Classes&lt;/strong&gt;: Giới hạn class con.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Records&lt;/strong&gt;: Data class ngắn gọn.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pattern Matching for switch&lt;/strong&gt;: Dễ đọc hơn.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-java&#34; data-lang=&#34;java&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;record&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;Point&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; x, &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; y) {}&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Point p &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; Point(1, 2);&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;System.&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;out&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;println&lt;/span&gt;(p.&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;());&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!-- raw HTML omitted --&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;N.B.&lt;/strong&gt; Cập nhật lên Java 17 để tận dụng các tính năng hiện đại và tối ưu code.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Async/Await in JavaScript</title>
      <link>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/async-await-in-javascript/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 20 Oct 2025 16:30:00 +0700</pubDate>
      <guid>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/async-await-in-javascript/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Async/Await là cú pháp được giới thiệu từ ES2017 giúp việc xử lý các tác vụ bất đồng bộ (asynchronous) trở nên dễ đọc và bảo trì hơn. Thay vì phải sử dụng callback hoặc Promise chaining phức tạp, bạn có thể viết code gần giống như lập trình đồng bộ.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;1-tổng-quan-về-asyncawait&#34;&gt;1. Tổng quan về Async/Await&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;async&lt;/code&gt; biến một hàm bình thường thành một Promise.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;await&lt;/code&gt; giúp “chờ” một Promise hoàn thành trước khi thực thi dòng lệnh tiếp theo.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Điều này đặc biệt hữu ích khi làm việc với API hoặc xử lý dữ liệu từ server.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Java Generics Explained</title>
      <link>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/java-generics-explained/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 20 Oct 2025 16:20:00 +0700</pubDate>
      <guid>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/java-generics-explained/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Generics giúp code Java an toàn kiểu dữ liệu và dễ bảo trì.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;vì-sao-cần-sử-dụng-generics&#34;&gt;Vì sao cần sử dụng Generics?&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-java&#34; data-lang=&#34;java&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;List&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;String&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; names &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; ArrayList&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;();&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;names.&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;add&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;Alice&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;);&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// names.add(10); // Lỗi biên dịch!&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;mẹo&#34;&gt;Mẹo&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Sử dụng &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;T&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt; cho class hoặc method.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Giúp tránh casting thủ công.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;!-- raw HTML omitted --&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;N.B.&lt;/strong&gt; Generics tăng type-safety nhưng không thể sử dụng với primitive types trực tiếp.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Understanding JavaScript Closures</title>
      <link>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/understanding-javascript-closures/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 20 Oct 2025 16:10:00 +0700</pubDate>
      <guid>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/understanding-javascript-closures/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Closures là một trong những khái niệm mạnh mẽ nhất trong JavaScript.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;closure-là-gì&#34;&gt;Closure là gì?&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Closure là khi một function nhớ được scope bên ngoài nó ngay cả khi function đó được gọi ở nơi khác:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-javascript&#34; data-lang=&#34;javascript&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;function&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;makeCounter&lt;/span&gt;() {&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;let&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;count&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;function&lt;/span&gt;() {&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;count&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;++&lt;/span&gt;;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;count&lt;/span&gt;;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  }&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;}&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;counter&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;makeCounter&lt;/span&gt;();&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;console&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;log&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;counter&lt;/span&gt;()); &lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// 1&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;console&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;log&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;counter&lt;/span&gt;()); &lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// 2&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;mẹo&#34;&gt;Mẹo&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Dùng closures để tạo private variables.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Tránh lạm dụng closures trong vòng lặp để prevent memory leaks.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;!-- raw HTML omitted --&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;N.B.&lt;/strong&gt; Closures là chìa khóa để hiểu nhiều pattern trong JS như module hoặc callback.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Java Streams Made Easy</title>
      <link>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/java-streams-made-easy/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 20 Oct 2025 16:00:00 +0700</pubDate>
      <guid>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/java-streams-made-easy/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Stream API là một trong những tính năng nổi bật của Java 8, giúp thao tác dữ liệu dễ dàng, hiệu quả và theo phong cách functional.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;1-stream-là-gì&#34;&gt;1. Stream là gì?&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Stream là chuỗi các phần tử dữ liệu hỗ trợ nhiều phép biến đổi (transformation) và tổng hợp (aggregation) mà không cần thay đổi cấu trúc dữ liệu gốc.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;2-cách-tạo-stream&#34;&gt;2. Cách tạo Stream&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Bạn có thể tạo Stream từ các nguồn dữ liệu như Collection, Array, hoặc I/O channel.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
